1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,930
AArchTune replaces manual, speed-only tuning with a bounded pipeline.

2
00:00:03,930 --> 00:00:17,600
It detects the hardware, records a fixed baseline, creates a deterministic candidate plan, deduplicates equivalent low-level signatures, screens candidates, evaluates the real workload, checks quality and temporal drift, and only then ranks eligible configurations.

3
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,810
Every decision remains attached to a hash-bound evidence trail.

